88130247,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU73bVs4pBAjH","name":"jactionlint_2.4.0_windows_arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":6777091,"digest":"sha256:1dfb63d0ca9b05024d4f66a9ead71720b68c0bfba70e79487ddb85b6956ce64b","download_count":21,"created_at":"2026-10-29T10:11:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:11:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/releases/download/v2.4.0/jactionlint_2.4.0_windows_arm64.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/jactionlint/releases/assets/688132629","id":688132629,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU73bVs4pBBIV","name":"packslip.sigstore.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":21692,"digest":"sha256:7390fdf4404d226c9908b94a06a31b9507832b0b5e407bc71a27db26fbd7e431","download_count":23223,"created_at":"2026-10-29T10:12:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:12:06Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/releases/download/v2.4.0/packslip.sigstore.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/jactionlint/tarball/v2.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/jactionlint/zipball/v2.4.0","body":"jactionlint 2.4.0 extends `invisible-characters` to report Private Use Area characters. It also fixes false positives in `artipacked` and `dependabot-syntax`, and stops the \"inconsistent fingerprint\" warnings when you upload SARIF to code scanning.\n\n## Added\n\n- **`invisible-characters` reports Private Use Area characters** (`U+E000`–`U+F8FF` and the two supplementary private-use planes). Most fonts have no glyph for these characters, so they can hide a payload that a script decodes at run time, the same way variation selectors can. The message calls them `PRIVATE USE CHARACTER`. The rule ID, profile, level and the fix that removes the character have not changed. If you use Nerd Font or Powerline icons on purpose, write them as escape sequences before you apply the fix. Otherwise the fix removes them. (#311, @jdx)\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **`artipacked`** no longer reports `actions/checkout` v6 and later. Starting with v6, checkout stores the credential in a file under `$RUNNER_TEMP` instead of the workspace, so uploading the workspace doesn't publish it. The rule skips v6+ tag refs, and also commit pins whose version comment says v6 or later. v5 and earlier are still reported. (#308, @jdx)\n- **`dependabot-syntax`** no longer reports an update with `multi-ecosystem-group` as a duplicate of the regular update for the same ecosystem and directory. Two updates are now duplicates only when they match on ecosystem, directory, target branch and group. Two ungrouped updates, or two updates in the same group, are still reported. (#314, @jdx)\n- **SARIF output no longer writes `primaryLocationLineHash`.** `github/codeql-action/upload-sarif` computes this value itself and logs an \"inconsistent fingerprint\" warning when a file supplies a different one. The fingerprint value is unchanged and is now stored under `jactionlint/contextHash/v1` in `partialFingerprints`. If your tools read jactionlint's fingerprint from `primaryLocationLineHash`, switch them to the new key. (#307, @jdx)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/jactionlint/compare/v2.3.0...v2.4.0\n\n## 💚 Sponsor jactionlint\n\njactionlint is a fork of [rhysd/actionlint](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), maintained by [@jdx](https://github.com/jdx), an open source developer at [**entire.io**](https://entire.io/), the title sponsor of his open source work.\n\nIf jactionlint has a place in your development workflow, please consider becoming an [individual or company sponsor](https://jdx.dev/sponsors.html). Your support funds ongoing development and helps keep jactionlint fast, free, and independent.\n","mentions_count":1}